%% section: Why replicas lag
%% caption: Where replication lag comes from
flowchart TB
    L["Replica is lagging"] --> A{"Where?"}
    A --> SHIP["Shipping — network between primary and replica"]
    A --> APPLY["Applying — replica cannot keep up"]
    APPLY --> SINGLE["Single-threaded apply against a parallel write load"]
    APPLY --> CONFL["Query conflicts — a long read blocks apply"]
    APPLY --> IOB["Replica disk slower than the primary's"]
    SHIP --> WAN["Cross-region latency or saturated link"]
    L --> IMPACT["Impact: stale reads, and the RPO if you fail over now"]
    IMPACT --> ROUTE["Route read-your-own-writes back to the primary"]
